{
    "title": "Weekly Meal System Creation",
    "content": "Create a complete weekly meal system including: (1) A 7-day dairy-free meal plan meeting 1600cal/120g protein targets, (2) An organized grocery list under $80/week, (3) A 60-90 minute Sunday prep workflow, and (4) Fast-food/convenience fallbacks for busy days. Uses parallel synthesis pattern where grocery list and prep workflow both depend on the meal plan design, while fallback research proceeds independently.",
    "tasks": [
        {
            "goal": "Design a 7-day dairy-free meal plan for one person targeting 1600 calories and 120g+ protein daily, with breakfast options (overnight oats or egg muffins), lunch options (grain bowls/wraps), and 2-3 rotating dinner recipes. Include specific ingredients, portions, and macro breakdowns for each meal.",
            "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
            "depends_on": []
        },
        {
            "goal": "Create a detailed grocery list organized by store section (produce, proteins, pantry, frozen) for the meal plan from Task 0, with estimated current prices to ensure total stays under $80/week. Differentiate between weekly fresh purchases and pantry staples.",
            "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
            "depends_on": [0]
        },
        {
            "goal": "Design a 60-90 minute weekly meal prep workflow (Sunday prep) for the meal plan from Task 0. Include step-by-step cooking order, batch cooking strategy, container storage instructions, and weekday assembly instructions for grab-and-go.",
            "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
            "depends_on": [0]
        },
        {
            "goal": "Research and compile 5-7 specific dairy-free high-protein 'busy day' fallback options from national fast food chains (Chipotle, Subway, Panera, etc.) and convenience stores. For each option provide: exact order modifications, estimated cost, calorie and protein content, and how it fits into the daily 1600cal/120g protein targets.",
            "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
            "depends_on": []
        },
        {
            "goal": "Synthesize the grocery list, prep workflow, and fallback options into a cohesive weekly meal system document with section headers, shopping tips for budget adherence, and motivational strategies for Thursday slumps.",
            "tool_name": "reasoning",
            "depends_on": [1, 2, 3]
        }
    ],
